        note="Admits exactly probes blocked within the hour past the shared read-only probe bound (the stop poll, terminate confirm, and status probes each wait an hour long); answered probes still follow the clock and caller cancellation still cancels. One shared site, three entries: each deadline test reddens alone (isolated attribution from single-test runs), because each verdict lands at the release instead of the bound.",
    ),
